  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF Strengthening of the Indonesian Institute of Accountants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives of the grant are to (i) help the IIA in adopting over time the IFAC Quality Assurance requirements, Int&apos;l Auditing Standards &amp; other Int&apos;l Auditing &amp; Assurance Standards Board (IAASB) pronouncements and the Int&apos;l Financial Reporting Standards (ii) promote the sustainability of the program by creating a cadre of proficient trainers capable of continuing the work of producing qualified accounts &amp; auditors (iii) assist the country in promoting a close partnership between private &amp; public sectors and strengthening he important nexus between corporate governance and good governance in the public sector.  Grant Amount:  $257,000</narrative>
  </description>
